---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config";
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy Policy | TripAxle"
  description="What TripAxle does and does not collect. Short version: no accounts, no tracking, no cookies set by us."
  heading="Privacy Policy"
  updated="2026-10-02"
>
  <p>
    TripAxle is a plain content website. We do not ask you for personal
    information, and we do not want any. There are no accounts, no newsletter,
    and no forms.
  </p>

  <h2>Cookies and tracking</h2>
  <p>
    TripAxle currently sets <strong>no cookies</strong> of its own and runs
    <strong>no analytics or tracking scripts</strong>. We do not build a profile
    of you or track you across other sites. If that changes — for example if
    measurement is added later — it will be described here first.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising and affiliate links</h2>
  <p>
    Some guides show a banner for our affiliate partner, Discover Cars, and link
    to it. The banner images are hosted on this site, so no advertising company
    sees you just because you viewed the page. If you click a banner or a
    “Compare cars” link, you leave TripAxle for the Discover Cars website; it and
    its affiliate platform use cookies there to credit TripAxle for any booking,
    under their own privacy policies. The link also carries a short label saying
    which TripAxle page you clicked from.
  </p>

  <h2>Third parties that see your request</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>
      <strong>Fonts.</strong> None. Typefaces are served from this site's own
      domain, so no font request goes to a third party and no one receives your
      IP address because of one.
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Hosting and security.</strong> The site is delivered through
      Cloudflare, which processes standard server logs and may set essential
      cookies to keep the site secure and running. See
      <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/" rel="noopener" target="_blank">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    <strong>Advertising</strong> is not on that list: the banners are served from
    this site, not from an ad network. The hosting arrangement above is an
    ordinary part of serving a website, not TripAxle collecting data about you.
  </p>

  <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
  <p>
    When you follow a link to another site — a rental company, a comparison
    service, an official airport page — that site's own privacy policy and
    cookies apply, not this one. That includes our affiliate partner, which may
    set its own cookies or record that you arrived from TripAxle; the commercial
    side is covered in the
    <a href="/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Children</h2>
  <p>TripAxle is general travel information and is not directed at children.</p>

  <h2>Questions and changes</h2>
  <p>
    If a contact form is added later, or anything else changes what we collect,
    this page will be updated with a new date. Questions about privacy can go
    through <a href="/contact/">Contact</a> once that is live — though in practice
    the only data connected to your visit is the server logs held by our host.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
